## Truth Incident #5 Record
Original micro-routing.json (v1.0) had single-label ground truth that was
fabricated from intuition. 33/46 labels were wrong because EventBridge routing
is fan-out (events match MULTIPLE rules). 22 events matched ZERO rules but
were assigned plausible queues that don't exist.

## Fix Summary
- Redesigned as multi-label classification (v2.0)
- Ground truth: verbatim from architect-verified truth table
  (.kiro/evidence/model-policy-evals/micro-routing-truth-table.md, commit 100fa3b)
- Prompts include full R-1..R-7 rule context (tests pattern-application, not memorization)
- groundTruthLabels: sorted string array per task; ["none"] for zero-match events
- expectedOutput: comma-separated sorted labels (or "none")
- Grader: multi-label set-F1 (computeSetF1 in exact-match.ts)

